      "description": "The checker of a translation round trip: renders a sample of the target-language text back into the source language from the target text alone, with no tools and without seeing the source. It rules on nothing. Its rendering is the intermediate the adjudicator reads (`untainted-verification`, rule 1: neither party sees what would let it shortcut).",
